    name: 迈凯伦车队
    short: MCL
    color: '#ff8000'
    principal: 安德里亚·斯特拉
    engine: 梅赛德斯
    base: 英国·沃金
    funds: 115
    sponsorIncome: 7.4
    operatingCost: 2.6
    targetPosition: 1
    facilities: { windTunnel: 5, cfd: 5, simulator: 5, factory: 5 }
    staff:
      technicalDirector: { name: 罗布·马歇尔, skill: 87, salary: 3 }
      aeroChief: { name: 彼得·普罗德罗穆, skill: 88, salary: 2.4 }
      raceEngineer: { name: 威尔·约瑟夫, skill: 84, salary: 1.1 }
      pitCrew: { skill: 92, salary: 1.8 }
      strategist: { name: 兰迪普·辛格, skill: 85, salary: 1.1 }
    carBase: { perf: 78, rel: 87 }
    parts:
      power_unit: { perf: 91, rel: 87 }
      ers: { perf: 86, rel: 85 }
      gearbox: { perf: 76.5, rel: 88 }
      chassis: { perf: 78.5, rel: 88 }
      front_wing: { perf: 77.5, rel: 87 }
      rear_wing: { perf: 76.5, rel: 87 }
      floor: { perf: 78.5, rel: 87 }
      sidepods: { perf: 76.5, rel: 88 }
      suspension: { perf: 79.5, rel: 88 }
    description: MCL40 · 梅赛德斯动力单元。2025 年车队与车手双冠王（833 分，诺里斯夺冠），以对轮胎友好的底盘著称。2026 年要在新规则下卫冕。

